   "plugin": "Core",
   "model": "Notes",
   "data": {
    "text": "EMOTIONAL ROAD\nPatch any CV (0 to 10 V) into a jack. 0 V is the item's From setting, 10 V its To.\n\nCV-CC 1: MIDI channel 6, CC 33 to 48\n   1 Where this character is on their road\n   2 Where the film is on its road\n   3 Does the feeling turn\n   4 Hidden to shown\n   5 How far the feeling spreads\n   6 Catharsis\n   7 Feeling held in\n   8 Hope\n   9 What they stand to lose\n  10 Breather\n  11 False high, false low\n  12 Two roads\n  13 A feeling comes back\n  14 Warmth between two\n  15 Dread\n  16 suite: Emotional road lens\nCV-CC 2: MIDI channel 6, CC 49 to 64\n   1 suite: Rock bottom\n   2 suite: Hope dies\n   3 suite: The midpoint win\n   4 suite: A rest stop\n   5 suite: Crossed roads\n   6 suite: The old song\n   7 suite: Slow dread\n   8 suite: Everything to lose\n   9 pair: When a character reaches their lowest point, their feeling turns\n  10 pair: After a low scene, a laugh\n  11 pair: A hidden feeling bursts out later\n  12 pair: After tension peaks, release follows\n  13 pair: When enough feeling is held in, it comes out\n  14 pair: When a false high peaks, the fall follows\n  15 pair: When a big feeling peaks, a breather follows\n  16 pair: When the stakes rise, hope gets fragile\nCV-CC 3: MIDI channel 6, CC 65 to 74\n   1 pair: When hope is lost, the release comes later\n   2 pair: When an old feeling comes back changed, the release arrives\n   3 pair: When dread builds, the music thins out\n   4 pair: When the warmth cools, the two roads part\n   5 pair: When the dread is lifted, a laugh comes\n   6 pairs: Emotional rollercoaster\n   7 pairs: The dam breaks\n   8 pairs: The fall and the rise\n   9 pairs: Breathing room\n  10 pairs: The pressure cooker"
   },
